ligned}]\n$$\n\nThen, we find the determinant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & \\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3} \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot 0-\\frac{\\sqrt{5}}{3}\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe absolute value of $det(M)$ gives the area $A$ of the parallelogram:\n\n$$\nA=|\\,0\\,|=0\n$$"}]}
